      "headline": "Birth of David Letterman",
      "text": "David Michael Letterman was born on April 12, 1947, in Indianapolis, Indiana, United States.",
      "date": "1947-04-12"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Graduation from Ball State University",
      "text": "David Letterman graduated from Ball State University in Muncie, Indiana, in 1969 with a degree in telecommunications.",
