      "headline": "AAP Resigns from Delhi Government",
      "text": "On 14 February 2014, Arvind Kejriwal resigned as Chief Minister after 49 days in office due to a failure to pass the Jan Lokpal Bill.",
      "date": "2014-02-14"
    },
