      "text": "Rani Lakshmibai was born as Manikarnika Tambe on November 19, 1828, in Varanasi, India.",
      "date": "1828-11-19"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Marriage to Maharaja Gangadhar Rao",
      "text": "In 1842, Manikarnika married Maharaja Gangadhar Rao Newalkar, the Maharaja of Jhansi, and was given the name Lakshmibai.",
