      "text": "In 1920, Ben-Gurion co-founded the Histadrut, the General Federation of Jewish Labor, which became a central institution in the Yishuv (Jewish community in Palestine).",
      "date": "1920"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Becomes Head of the Jewish Agency",
      "text": "In 1935, Ben-Gurion became the head of the Jewish Agency, effectively making him the leader of the Jewish community in Palestine.",
      "date": "1935"
    },
