      "text": "On August 31, 2014, a collection of nearly five hundred private pictures of various celebrities, mostly women, with many containing nudity, were posted on the imageboard 4chan. The leak was dubbed 'The Fappening' or 'Celebgate' by the public.",
      "date": "2014-08-31"
    },
