    },
    {
      "headline": "Initial Belief of iCloud Breach",
      "text": "The images were initially believed to have been obtained via a breach of Apple's cloud services suite iCloud, or a security issue in the iCloud API which allowed unlimited attempts at guessing victims' passwords.",
      "date": "2014-08-31"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Apple's Response",
      "text": "Apple claimed in a press release that access to the images was gained via spear phishing attacks, not a breach of their iCloud services.",
      "date": "2014-09"
