      "text": "Between 1945-02-14 and 1945-02-15, the third and fourth raids were conducted by the RAF and the United States Army Air Forces (USAAF), dropping more than 3,900 tons of bombs on Dresden. The bombings resulted in a massive firestorm that devastated the city center.",
