      "headline": "Beginning of the Invasion",
      "text": "On 24 February 2022, Russia launched a full-scale invasion of Ukraine, marking a major escalation of the Russo-Ukrainian War that began in 2014.",
      "date": "2022-02-24"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Initial Occupation",
      "text": "By March 2022, Russian forces had occupied significant portions of Ukraine, including areas in the north, east, and south of the country.",
      "date": "2022-03"
    },
