      "text": "Super Bowl XXXVI was played on February 3, 2002, between the NFC champion St. Louis Rams and the AFC champion New England Patriots. The game took place at the Louisiana Superdome in New Orleans, Louisiana. The New England Patriots, considered underdogs, defeated the St. Louis Rams 20–17, marking the Patriots' first Super Bowl championship and the franchise's first league championship of any kind.",
