      "headline": "Pierre-Joseph Proudhon Publishes 'What is Property?'",
      "text": "In 1840, Pierre-Joseph Proudhon published 'What is Property?', where he famously declared that 'property is theft'. This work is considered one of the first expressions of modern anarchist thought.",
      "date": "1840"
