      "headline": "Founding of Albuquerque",
      "text": "Albuquerque was founded in 1706 as La Villa de Alburquerque by Santa Fe de Nuevo México governor Francisco Cuervo y Valdés. It was named in honor of Francisco Fernández de la Cueva, 10th Duke of Alburquerque and Viceroy of New Spain.",
      "date": "1706"
