    },
    {
      "headline": "Standardization of Portuguese",
      "text": "The 16th century saw the standardization of Portuguese, particularly through the works of writers like Luís de Camões, whose epic poem 'Os Lusíadas' was published in 1572.",
      "date": "1572"
    },
