      "headline": "Formation of Village People",
      "text": "The Village People were formed in 1977 by French producers Jacques Morali and Henri Belolo, along with lead singer Victor Willis. The group was created following the release of their debut album, which targeted disco's large gay audience.",
      "date": "1977"
    },
