      "text": "John Herschel Glenn Jr. was born on July 18, 1921, in Cambridge, Ohio, United States.",
      "date": "1921-07-18"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Enlistment in the U.S. Marine Corps",
      "text": "In 1942, John Glenn enlisted in the U.S. Marine Corps, where he began his career as an aviator.",
      "date": "1942"
    },
    {
      "headline": "World War II Service",
      "text": "During World War II, Glenn flew 59 combat missions in the South Pacific as a Marine Corps aviator.",
      "date": "1944"
    },
