      "text": "The Waffen-SS was officially established as the armed wing of the SS in 1939, shortly before the outbreak of World War II.",
      "date": "1939"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Invasion of Poland",
      "text": "The Waffen-SS participated in the invasion of Poland in September 1939, marking its first major military engagement.",
      "date": "1939-09"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Expansion and Recruitment",
      "text": "Throughout 1940, the Waffen-SS expanded significantly, recruiting volunteers and conscripts from across German-occupied Europe.",
      "date": "1940"
    },
