      "headline": "Operation Barbarossa",
      "text": "In June 1941, the Waffen-SS took part in Operation Barbarossa, the German invasion of the Soviet Union.",
      "date": "1941-06"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Battle of Kharkov",
      "text": "In early 1943, the Waffen-SS played a key role in the Third Battle of Kharkov, a successful counter-offensive against Soviet forces.",
