      "text": "On July 22, 2011, following the Oslo bombing, Anders Behring Breivik carried out a mass shooting at a Workers' Youth League (AUF) summer camp on the island of Utøya. The attack began at approximately 17:22 CEST and resulted in the deaths of 69 people, mostly teenagers, and injured 110 others.",
