      "text": "The Battle of Qadisiyyah in 636 was a decisive victory for the Rashidun Caliphate against the Sassanian Empire.",
      "date": "0636"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Assassination of Umar",
      "text": "Caliph Umar was assassinated in 644 by a Persian slave named Abu Lu'lu'a Firuz.",
      "date": "0644"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Uthman ibn Affan becomes the third Caliph",
      "text": "Uthman ibn Affan was elected as the third caliph in 644 following Umar's assassination.",
      "date": "0644"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Compilation of the Quran",
      "text": "During Uthman's caliphate, the Quran was compiled into a single book form around 650.",
