      "text": "Seville was originally founded as the Roman city of Hispalis. The exact date of its founding is not known, but it was established during the Roman Republic period.",
      "date": "-0200"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Visigothic Rule",
      "text": "After the fall of the Roman Empire, Seville came under the control of the Visigoths in the 5th century.",
      "date": "0500"
