    },
    {
      "headline": "Introduction of Single Zero",
      "text": "In 1843, in the German spa casino town of Bad Homburg, François and Louis Blanc introduced the single zero style roulette wheel to compete against other casinos offering the traditional wheel with both single and double zero slots.",
