      "headline": "Establishment of the WTO",
      "text": "The World Trade Organization (WTO) was established on January 1, 1995, following the conclusion of the Uruguay Round of negotiations and the signing of the Marrakesh Agreement.",
      "date": "1995-01-01"
    },
    {
      "headline": "First Ministerial Conference",
      "text": "The first WTO Ministerial Conference was held in Singapore from December 9 to 13, 1996. It addressed issues such as trade and investment, trade and competition policy, transparency in government procurement, and trade facilitation.",
