      "headline": "Establishment of the Shanghai Cooperation Organisation",
      "text": "The Shanghai Cooperation Organisation (SCO) was established on June 15, 2001, by China, Russia, Kazakhstan, Kyrgyzstan, Tajikistan, and Uzbekistan. The organization was founded to strengthen regional security, economic cooperation, and cultural exchange.",
