      "headline": "Expansion with Observer States",
      "text": "In 2004, Mongolia became the first observer state of the SCO, followed by India, Iran, and Pakistan in 2005. This expansion marked the growing influence and reach of the organization.",
      "date": "2004"
    },
    {
