      "text": "The Circassians are indigenous to the region of Circassia in the North Caucasus, with evidence of their presence dating back to ancient times.",
      "date": "-2000"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Christianization",
      "text": "By the 6th century, the Circassians had been influenced by the Byzantine Empire and adopted Christianity.",
      "date": "0600"
