      "headline": "Exposition Universelle (Paris 1900)",
      "text": "The 1900 Exposition Universelle was held in Paris, France, from April 14 to November 12, 1900. It showcased achievements in technology and culture at the turn of the century.",
      "date": "1900-04-14"
