      "headline": "Panama–Pacific International Exposition",
      "text": "The Panama–Pacific International Exposition was held in San Francisco, United States, from February 20 to December 4, 1915. It celebrated the completion of the Panama Canal.",
      "date": "1915-02-20"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Century of Progress International Exposition",
      "text": "The Century of Progress International Exposition was held in Chicago, United States, from May 27, 1933, to November 12, 1933, and again from May 26, 1934, to October 31, 1934. It celebrated Chicago's centennial and focused on technological innovation.",
      "date": "1933-05-27"
