      "text": "The Black Sun symbol first appeared in Nazi Germany as a design element in the North Tower of Wewelsburg Castle, which was remodeled and expanded by Heinrich Himmler, the head of the SS. The symbol consists of twelve radial sig runes, similar to those used in the SS logo.",
