      "headline": "Emergence of Punk Rock",
      "text": "Punk rock emerged in the mid-1970s as a reaction against the perceived excesses of mainstream 1970s rock music. It drew inspiration from 1950s rock and roll and 1960s garage rock.",
      "date": "1970"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Formation of The Ramones",
      "text": "The Ramones, one of the first punk rock bands, formed in 1974 in New York City. They are often credited with pioneering the punk rock sound.",
