      "headline": "Council of Nicaea",
      "text": "In 325, the First Council of Nicaea was convened by Emperor Constantine I. The council condemned Arianism and declared that the Son was of the same substance as the Father.",
      "date": "0325"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Exile of Arius",
      "text": "Following the Council of Nicaea, Arius was exiled and his teachings were officially denounced.",
      "date": "0325"
