      "headline": "First War of Independence",
      "text": "The Indian Rebellion of 1857, also known as the First War of Independence, began in May 1857. It was a major, but ultimately unsuccessful, uprising against the British East India Company's rule.",
      "date": "1857-05"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Formation of the Indian National Congress",
      "text": "The Indian National Congress (INC) was founded in December 1885. It became the principal leader of the Indian independence movement.",
