      "headline": "Jallianwala Bagh Massacre",
      "text": "On April 13, 1919, British troops under General Dyer fired on a peaceful gathering at Jallianwala Bagh in Amritsar, killing hundreds of Indians.",
      "date": "1919-04-13"
