      "text": "The Quit India Movement was launched by the INC on August 8, 1942, demanding an end to British rule in India.",
      "date": "1942-08-08"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Indian Independence Act",
      "text": "The Indian Independence Act was passed by the British Parliament on July 18, 1947, leading to the partition of India and the creation of India and Pakistan as independent dominions.",
      "date": "1947-07-18"
