      "headline": "Virgil's Education",
      "text": "Virgil received his education in Cremona, Milan, and Rome, where he studied a variety of subjects including rhetoric, medicine, and astronomy.",
      "date": "-0050"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Publication of the Eclogues",
      "text": "Around 39-38 BCE, Virgil published the Eclogues, a collection of ten pastoral poems that brought him immediate fame.",
      "date": "-0039"
