    {
      "headline": "Six-Day War",
      "text": "In June 1967, Sharon commanded an armored division during the Six-Day War, achieving significant victories in the Sinai Peninsula.",
      "date": "1967-06"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Yom Kippur War",
      "text": "In October 1973, during the Yom Kippur War, Sharon led a successful counterattack across the Suez Canal, encircling the Egyptian Third Army.",
