      "headline": "Lebanon War and Sabra and Shatila Massacre",
      "text": "In 1982, Sharon oversaw the Israeli invasion of Lebanon. He was later found indirectly responsible for the Sabra and Shatila massacre.",
      "date": "1982"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Resignation as Minister of Defense",
      "text": "In 1983, Sharon resigned as Minister of Defense following the Kahan Commission's findings on the Sabra and Shatila massacre.",
      "date": "1983"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Becomes Prime Minister of Israel",
      "text": "On March 7, 2001, Ariel Sharon was elected as the Prime Minister of Israel.",
      "date": "2001-03-07"
