    },
    {
      "headline": "Goethe's 'Faust'",
      "text": "Johann Wolfgang von Goethe began writing his version of 'Faust' in the late 18th century. The first part was published in 1808, and the second part was completed posthumously in 1832. Goethe's 'Faust' is considered one of the greatest works of German literature.",
      "date": "1808"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Gounod's Opera 'Faust'",
      "text": "Charles Gounod's opera 'Faust,' based on Goethe's work, premiered in Paris in 1859. It became one of the most popular operas of the 19th century.",
