      "headline": "Establishment of the Kingdom of the Netherlands",
      "text": "The Kingdom of the Netherlands was established on March 16, 1815, following the defeat of Napoleon. It was formed by merging the former Dutch Republic with the Southern Netherlands.",
      "date": "1815-03-16"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Belgian Revolution",
      "text": "In 1830, the Belgian Revolution led to the secession of the southern provinces from the Kingdom of the Netherlands, resulting in the establishment of Belgium as an independent kingdom.",
