      "text": "On December 1, 1918, the Great Union was proclaimed, leading to the unification of Transylvania, Banat, Bessarabia, and Bukovina with the Kingdom of Romania, celebrated annually as Romania's National Day.",
      "date": "1918-12-01"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Communist Regime Established",
      "text": "In 1947, the communist regime was established in Romania, with Bucharest as the center of political power.",
