      "date": "1980-04-24"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Algiers Accords Signed",
      "text": "On January 19, 1981, the Algiers Accords were signed, which facilitated the release of the hostages. The agreement was mediated by Algeria and included the unfreezing of Iranian assets.",
