      "text": "NITI Aayog was formed on January 1, 2015, replacing the Planning Commission of India. It serves as the apex public policy think tank of the Government of India, with a focus on fostering cooperative federalism and catalyzing economic development.",
      "date": "2015-01-01"
    },
