      "headline": "ARMv8-A Architecture Announcement",
      "text": "ARM announced the ARMv8-A architecture in 2011, introducing 64-bit processing capabilities to the ARM architecture family.",
      "date": "2011"
    },
    {
      "headline": "SoftBank Acquisition of ARM Holdings",
      "text": "In 2016, SoftBank Group acquired ARM Holdings for approximately $32 billion.",
      "date": "2016"
