      "headline": "Defends World Heavyweight Title",
      "text": "Liston successfully defended his world heavyweight title on July 22, 1963, by again knocking out Floyd Patterson in the first round, this time in Las Vegas, Nevada. He also became the inaugural WBC heavyweight champion.",
