      "headline": "Beginning of Black September",
      "text": "The conflict known as Black September began on 16 September 1970, when King Hussein of Jordan declared martial law following increasing tensions with the Palestine Liberation Organization (PLO).",
      "date": "1970-09-16"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Battle of Amman",
      "text": "Fighting broke out in the Jordanian capital of Amman on 17 September 1970, as Jordanian forces clashed with PLO fighters.",
