      "headline": "Khazar Conversion to Judaism",
      "text": "In the 8th or 9th century, the Khazar elite, including the ruling class, converted to Judaism. This conversion is one of the most significant events in Khazar history, as it distinguished them from their Christian and Muslim neighbors.",
