      "headline": "Birth of Sméagol",
      "text": "Sméagol, later known as Gollum, was born as a Stoor Hobbit of the River-folk who lived near the Gladden Fields. His birth date is not precisely known, but it is estimated to be around the year 2430 of the Third Age.",
      "date": "2430"
