      "headline": "Transformation into Gollum",
      "text": "After acquiring the One Ring, Sméagol was gradually corrupted by its power and was driven away by his people. He took refuge in the Misty Mountains, where he became known as Gollum due to the gurgling noise he made in his throat.",
      "date": "2470"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Encounter with Bilbo Baggins",
      "text": "In the year 2941 of the Third Age, Gollum encountered Bilbo Baggins in the depths of the Misty Mountains. During this encounter, Bilbo found the One Ring and used it to escape from Gollum.",
      "date": "2941"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Capture and Interrogation by Sauron's Forces",
      "text": "Gollum was captured by Sauron's forces and taken to Barad-dûr, where he was tortured and revealed information about the Ring and its new owner, 'Baggins' from the Shire.",
      "date": "3017"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Release and Capture by Aragorn",
      "text": "After being released by Sauron's forces, Gollum was captured by Aragorn and taken to the Elves of Mirkwood for safekeeping.",
      "date": "3018"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Escape from Mirkwood",
      "text": "Gollum managed to escape from the Elves of Mirkwood, beginning his search for the Ring once more.",
      "date": "3018"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Meeting Frodo and Sam",
      "text": "Gollum encountered Frodo Baggins and Samwise Gamgee in the Emyn Muil and became their guide to Mordor, hoping to reclaim the Ring.",
      "date": "3019"
