      "text": "Adam Smith published 'An Inquiry into the Nature and Causes of the Wealth of Nations' in 1776, laying the foundations for classical economics.",
      "date": "1776"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Publication of 'Principles of Political Economy and Taxation'",
      "text": "David Ricardo published 'Principles of Political Economy and Taxation' in 1817, introducing the theory of comparative advantage.",
