    },
    {
      "headline": "Publication of 'The General Theory of Employment, Interest and Money'",
      "text": "John Maynard Keynes published 'The General Theory of Employment, Interest and Money' in 1936, revolutionizing economic thought and policy with Keynesian economics.",
