      "text": "The International Monetary Fund (IMF) was established in 1944 during the Bretton Woods Conference to promote international monetary cooperation.",
      "date": "1944"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Publication of 'Capitalism and Freedom'",
      "text": "Milton Friedman published 'Capitalism and Freedom' in 1962, advocating for free-market policies and minimal government intervention.",
