    },
    {
      "headline": "Release of 'Aqualung'",
      "text": "The band released 'Aqualung' in March 1971, which became one of their most successful and critically acclaimed albums.",
      "date": "1971-03"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Release of 'Thick as a Brick'",
      "text": "In March 1972, Jethro Tull released 'Thick as a Brick', a concept album that featured a single continuous piece of music.",
      "date": "1972-03"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Release of 'A Passion Play'",
      "text": "Jethro Tull released 'A Passion Play' in July 1973, another concept album that continued their exploration of progressive rock.",
