      "headline": "The Great Battle",
      "text": "During Ragnarök, a great battle takes place between the gods (Æsir and Vanir) and the forces of chaos, including giants and monsters led by Loki. Many gods, including Odin, Thor, Freyr, and Heimdallr, perish in this battle.",
      "date": "-"
